{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"thread\": \"一个人渐渐爱上了另一个人，享受彼此亲近，却始终害怕自己的喜欢成为负担，也害怕对方有一天不再需要自己。他在想坦白、想退缩、渴望永远和接受无常之间反复摇摆，最后决定不再强求永恒的保证，坦然表达自己的喜欢，并愿意继续陪伴对方。\",\n  \"sections\": [\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S01\",\n      \"caught\": \"心动又怕添负担\",\n      \"echo\": \"\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S02\",\n      \"caught\": \"亲近甜蜜又不舍\",\n      \"echo\": \"S01\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S03\",\n      \"caught\": \"沉醉当下却说不出\",\n      \"echo\": \"S02\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S04\",\n      \"caught\": \"想坦白留住亲近\",\n      \"echo\": \"S03\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S05\",\n      \"caught\": \"露出喜欢怕被嫌黏\",\n      \"echo\": \"S04\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S06\",\n      \"caught\": \"被看见后孤单退缩\",\n      \"echo\": \"S05\",\n      \"why\": \"勉强\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S07\",\n      \"caught\": \"沉溺依恋盼被需要\",\n      \"echo\": \"S02\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S08\",\n      \"caught\": \"主动回应亲近\",\n      \"echo\": \"S02\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S09\",\n      \"caught\": \"渴望与不安拉扯\",\n      \"echo\": \"S05\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S10\",\n      \"caught\": \"暂不猜以后先放松\",\n      \"echo\": \"S09\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S11\",\n      \"caught\": \"不求保证仍愿陪伴\",\n      \"echo\": \"S07\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S12\",\n      \"caught\": \"不再压抑全心付出\",\n      \"echo\": \"S11\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S13\",\n      \"caught\": \"想要保证又怕失去\",\n      \"echo\": \"S09\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S14\",\n      \"caught\": \"放下保证终于说出心意\",\n      \"echo\": \"S13\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"overall\": \"最吃力的是 S06 到 S07：从被看见后的孤单，转向强烈的依恋和渴望被需要，情绪转折比较突然，仅凭大字不太容易完全理解其中的心理联系。最抓人的是 S02 和 S14：前者有两个人亲近时甜蜜又害怕失去的矛盾，后者则让开头不敢表达的心意终于有了回应，形成了很清楚的首尾呼应。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "87c57d89-7044-4991-9afd-9b5bd2da9514", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261105T190337408636Z", "elapsed_seconds": 37.203, "completed_utc": "2026-11-05T19:04:14.606042+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "1f58e9693a4d0f42202312637b3dc5bafc934357eae6d99c893aaf40e560795d", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261105T190337408636Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "15019ca4ce46f87ed51e24b323a19aa41f9a86212f2d87ac11cae666afe8fc70"}}}
